{"page":306,"width":1793,"height":2505,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"12. 지금까지 작성한 프로그램을 실행하면 다음과 같은 출력을 확인할 수 있습니다.","words":[{"text":"12.","x":186,"y":160,"width":47,"height":28},{"text":"지금까지","x":248,"y":156,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"작성한","x":392,"y":158,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"프로그램을","x":502,"y":157,"width":158,"height":34},{"text":"실행하면","x":672,"y":158,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"다음과","x":800,"y":160,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"같은","x":900,"y":160,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"출력을","x":972,"y":160,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"확인할","x":1079,"y":160,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1186,"y":162,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"있습니다.","x":1233,"y":162,"width":135,"height":35}]},{"text":"강한 연결 요소 개수: 4","words":[{"text":"강한","x":249,"y":257,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"연결","x":322,"y":258,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"요소","x":393,"y":262,"width":53,"height":23},{"text":"개수:","x":465,"y":261,"width":61,"height":29},{"text":"4","x":547,"y":261,"width":16,"height":25}]},{"text":"[312456","words":[{"text":"[312456","x":253,"y":405,"width":176,"height":34}]},{"text":"[41387","words":[{"text":"[41387","x":254,"y":455,"width":143,"height":34}]},{"text":"7.72 실습 문제 17: 미로-순간이동 게임","words":[{"text":"7.72","x":193,"y":677,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"실습","x":328,"y":672,"width":86,"height":47},{"text":"문제","x":429,"y":673,"width":83,"height":47},{"text":"17:","x":529,"y":677,"width":56,"height":39},{"text":"미로-순간이동","x":605,"y":672,"width":264,"height":47},{"text":"게임","x":884,"y":672,"width":73,"height":46}]},{"text":"여러 개의 방으로 구성된 미로 안에 여러 명의 플레이어가 무작위로 배文1되는 게임을 설계한다고","words":[{"text":"여러","x":194,"y":795,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"개의","x":273,"y":794,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"방으로","x":352,"y":794,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"구성된","x":464,"y":794,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"미로","x":576,"y":794,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"안에","x":651,"y":793,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"여러","x":726,"y":793,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"명의","x":799,"y":792,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"플레이어가","x":870,"y":792,"width":150,"height":36},{"text":"무작위로","x":1030,"y":793,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"배文1되는","x":1161,"y":794,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"게임을","x":1296,"y":792,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"설계한다고","x":1403,"y":792,"width":167,"height":36}]},{"text":"가정해보겠습니다. 각 방에는 미로의 다른 방으로 이동할 수 있는 한 개 이상의 순간이동장치가","words":[{"text":"가정해보겠습니다.","x":193,"y":863,"width":273,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":486,"y":863,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"방에는","x":533,"y":863,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"미로의","x":644,"y":861,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":750,"y":861,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"방으로","x":825,"y":861,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"이동할","x":931,"y":861,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1032,"y":861,"width":30,"height":35},{"text":"있는","x":1076,"y":861,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"한","x":1145,"y":862,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"개","x":1190,"y":862,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"이상의","x":1234,"y":861,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"순간이동장치가","x":1337,"y":861,"width":233,"height":35}]},{"text":"있습니다. 각각의 순간이동장치는 고유한 정수 값이 매겨져 있어서 플레이어가 순간이동장지를","words":[{"text":"있습니다.","x":195,"y":931,"width":137,"height":36},{"text":"각각의","x":353,"y":932,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"순간이동장치는","x":468,"y":930,"width":227,"height":36},{"text":"고유한","x":709,"y":929,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"정수","x":817,"y":929,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"값이","x":892,"y":929,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"매겨져","x":968,"y":929,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"있어서","x":1072,"y":929,"width":83,"height":35},{"text":"플레이어가","x":1173,"y":930,"width":152,"height":34},{"text":"순간이동장지를","x":1338,"y":929,"width":230,"height":36}]},{"text":"A卜\u0026하면 해당 값이 플레이어 점수에 더해집니다. 각각의 플레이어는 모든 방을 한 번 이상 방문","words":[{"text":"A卜\u0026하면","x":192,"y":999,"width":131,"height":35},{"text":"해당","x":339,"y":1000,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"값이","x":419,"y":